  "description_text": "Welcome to 247 Madrid St! Beautifully renovated and completely move-in ready, this spacious 5-bedroom, 3-bathroom home offers the perfect combination of modern upgrades, comfort, and convenience. Step inside to discover a beautifully updated interior featuring a renovated kitchen, tastefully remodeled bathrooms, new flooring, doors, windows, and paint throughout. Have peace of mind with central heating, copper pipes, tankless water heater, newer 125A panel, retrofitted foundation, and a solar panel system that has been fully paid off. The attached garage has Tesla charger ready equipment. Home and pest reports are clean. Conveniently located near shopping, dining, schools, parks, and major commuter routes, making everyday living a breeze.",
